{#
  ONTON, FIRST THUMBNAIL — Figma 1490:21842 (exported as Assets/v4/work/
  onton/link.svg), with its prototype animation: "Event" and "TON" rise in,
  the link between them closes, then both slide together and fade, on a
  5s loop. The timings and easings are the Figma timeline's.

  It plays only while it is the thumbnail at the front (.is-play, set by
  scripts/v4-strip.js); anywhere else, and with reduced motion, it rests on
  the linked "Event ↔ TON". It ends on the ONTON lockup (1537:101220,
  hidden in the file and not in the export): the logo from
  Assets/v4/experience/onton.svg and the word set in Figtree.
#}
